{"3970880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eggspedition", "steam_appid": 3970880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST EGGSPEDITION        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=596 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/ce1e3d990847c22e3ca45b8374541ab5.mp4?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><strong>ENTER THE EGGSPEDITION - A TERRIFYING SURVIVAL HORROR WITH DINOSAURS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 players to explore unknown planets, abandoned facilities, complete missions, and make daring extractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first directive? - Seems simple… until you open your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been drop-podded onto an uncharted Class X-13 planet. Terrain: dense jungles, jagged mountains, and untouched mineral veins. The catch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s inhabited by… dinosaurs. Furious, massive, and very much alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One mission. One rule: “No egg, no evac.”</i><br><i></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EVERY MISSION IS A NEW HELL</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/2e64889460f2736ff90755d41afc53d4.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/2e64889460f2736ff90755d41afc53d4.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what awaits you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you even step out of the drop pod, all you see is the difficulty level. The rest? A complete unknown. One mission might have you extracting rare minerals from an active crater, another — tracking down a lost egg, or securing a zone crawling with predators.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DANGEROUS ENEMIES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/c167f6f5db4e16c453406e7d3312c210.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/c167f6f5db4e16c453406e7d3312c210.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll face bloodthirsty dinosaurs that have evolved to hunt — and survive. From the swift, cunning velociraptors, striking silently and in packs, to the monumental Tyrannosaurus Rex, a living engine of destruction whose roar can paralyze even the toughest soldier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every predator has its own way of fighting, its own territory, its own method of tearing apart the careless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/4310753e07b1ea48d69c88c93e7ecdf1.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/4310753e07b1ea48d69c88c93e7ecdf1.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in your crew. Only through tight teamwork do you stand a chance of completing the mission — and making it back in one piece. One scans the terrain, another provides cover, while a third carries the egg under enemy fire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, every move, every decision can mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE &amp; SURVIVE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/957170b46ff218308c172ce9b5e15848.webm?t=1758651939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various abandoned planets. Discover new territories and survive the challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADES &amp; GEAR PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970880/extras/020ad831a56ec33293ff6dc2146c05ca.poster.avif?t=1758651939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst